@startuml
hide footbox
actor Mahasiswa
boundary "Halaman Upload Laporan"
control "Control Upload Laporan"
database "Database Laporan"

Mahasiswa -> "Halaman Upload Laporan": Membuka dashboard
Mahasiswa -> "Halaman Upload Laporan": Memilih program yang diikuti
Mahasiswa -> "Halaman Upload Laporan": Masuk ke detail program
Mahasiswa -> "Halaman Upload Laporan": Memilih file laporan rancangan
Mahasiswa -> "Halaman Upload Laporan": Upload laporan rancangan kegiatan
"Halaman Upload Laporan" -> "Control Upload Laporan": Kirim file laporan
"Control Upload Laporan" -> "Control Upload Laporan": Validasi format dan ukuran file

alt File valid
    "Control Upload Laporan" -> "Database Laporan": Simpan file laporan
    "Database Laporan" --> "Control Upload Laporan": Konfirmasi penyimpanan berhasil
    "Control Upload Laporan" -> "Database Laporan": Update status laporan (pending)
    "Control Upload Laporan" -> "Halaman Upload Laporan": Kirim status laporan
    
    "Control Upload Laporan" -> "Database Laporan": Cek status verifikasi pamong & dpl
    "Database Laporan" --> "Control Upload Laporan": Data status verifikasi
    
    alt Status sudah diterima pamong & dpl
        "Control Upload Laporan" -> "Database Laporan": Aktifkan akses logbook
        "Control Upload Laporan" -> "Halaman Upload Laporan": Kirim notifikasi akses logbook
        "Halaman Upload Laporan" -> Mahasiswa: Tampilkan akses logbook tersedia
    else Status belum diterima
        "Control Upload Laporan" -> "Halaman Upload Laporan": Kirim status menunggu verifikasi
        "Halaman Upload Laporan" -> Mahasiswa: Tampilkan status menunggu verifikasi
    end
else File tidak valid
    "Control Upload Laporan" -> "Halaman Upload Laporan": Kirim pesan error file
    "Halaman Upload Laporan" -> Mahasiswa: Tampilkan pesan error file
end
@enduml 